---
<section class="section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="kicker">功能特性</span>
      <h2>简单管理SSL证书，从申请到续期自动完成</h2>
      <p>Tossl将复杂的SSL证书申请流程进行自动化处理，无需手动执行命令，即可完成证书申请、验证、安装和续期。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features-grid">
      {features.map((f, i) => (
        <div class="feature-card reveal" style={"--reveal-delay:" + (i % 4) * 0.08 + "s"}>
          <div class="icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d={f.icon} /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>{f.title}</h3>
          <p>{f.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
